{"id":"pt_text_manyo_iwami_aishou","title_original":"万葉集・人麻呂・石見相聞歌","title_ja":"柿本人麻呂「石見の海角の浦廻を」","author_name_display":"柿本人麻呂","era_year":695,"era_period":"上代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"ojp","form_genre":"長歌","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"石見の海 角の浦廻を 浦なしと\n人こそ見らめ 潟なしと 人こそ見らめ","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ja.wikisource.org/wiki/萬葉集","source_archive":"Wikisource ja","canonical_tier":1},
