{"id":"pt_text_manyo_kasa_kanamura","title_original":"万葉集・笠金村「みさご居る磯廻に生ふる」","title_ja":"笠金村「みさご居る磯廻に生ふる名乗藻の」","author_name_display":"笠金村","era_year":725,"era_period":"上代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"ojp","form_genre":"短歌","length_lines":5,"full_text_or_excerpt":"みさご居る 磯廻に生ふる 名乗藻の\n名は告らしてよ 親は知るとも","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ja.wikisource.org/wiki/萬葉集","source_archive":"Wikisource ja","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_manyo_takechi_kurohito2","title_original":"万葉集・高市黒人「桜田へ鶴鳴き渡る」","title_ja":"高市黒人「桜田へ鶴鳴き渡る」","author_name_display":"高市黒人","era_year":700,"era_period":"上代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"ojp","form_genre":"短歌","length_lines":5,"full_text_or_excerpt":"桜田へ 鶴鳴き渡る 年魚市潟\n潮干にけらし 鶴鳴き渡る","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ja.wikisource.org/wiki/萬葉集","source_archive":"Wikisource ja","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_manyo_yamabe_aka_seki","title_original":"万葉集・山部赤人「ぬばたまの夜の更けゆけば」","title_ja":"山部赤人「ぬばたまの夜の更けゆけば」","author_name_display":"山部赤人","era_year":725,"era_period":"上代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"ojp","form_genre":"短歌","length_lines":5,"full_text_or_excerpt":"ぬばたまの 夜の更けゆけば 久木生ふる\n清き川原に 千鳥しば鳴く","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ja.wikisource.org/wiki/萬葉集","source_archive":"Wikisource ja","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_manyo_otomo_yakamochi_yu","title_original":"万葉集・家持「春の野に霞たなびき」","title_ja":"大伴家持「春の野に霞たなびき」","author_name_display":"大伴家持","era_year":753,"era_period":"上代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"ojp","form_genre":"短歌","length_lines":5,"full_text_or_excerpt":"春の野に 霞たなびき うら悲し\nこの夕影に 鶯鳴くも","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ja.wikisource.org/wiki/萬葉集","source_archive":"Wikisource ja","canonical_tier":1},
