{"id":"pt_text_goshui_sagami","title_original":"後拾遺・相模「うらみわび」","title_ja":"相模「恨みわび干さぬ袖だに」","author_name_display":"相模","era_year":1050,"era_period":"平安","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"ojp","form_genre":"短歌","length_lines":5,"full_text_or_excerpt":"恨みわび 干さぬ袖だに あるものを\n恋に朽ちなむ 名こそ惜しけれ","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ja.wikisource.org/wiki/後拾遺和歌集","source_archive":"Wikisource ja","canonical_tier":1},
