{"id":"pt_text_senzaishu_kunpou","title_original":"千載集・俊恵法師「夜もすがら」","title_ja":"俊恵法師「夜もすがら物思ふ頃は」","author_name_display":"俊恵","era_year":1180,"era_period":"中世","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"ojp","form_genre":"短歌","length_lines":5,"full_text_or_excerpt":"夜もすがら 物思ふ頃は 明けやらで\n閨のひまさへ つれなかりけり","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://ja.wikisource.org/wiki/千載和歌集","source_archive":"Wikisource ja","canonical_tier":2},
