{"id":"pt_text_chuya_haru","title_original":"中也「春の日の夕暮」","title_ja":"中原中也「春の日の夕暮」","author_name_display":"中原中也","era_year":1934,"era_period":"近代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"jpn","form_genre":"自由詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"トタンがセンベイ食べて\n春の日の夕暮は穏かです\nアンダースローされた灰が蒼ざめて\n春の日の夕暮は静かです","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/000026/","source_archive":"青空文庫","canonical_tier":1},
