{"id":"pt_text_shimazaki_komoroya","title_original":"藤村「小諸なる古城のほとり」","title_ja":"島崎藤村「千曲川旅情の歌」","author_name_display":"島崎藤村","era_year":1900,"era_period":"近代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"jpn","form_genre":"新体詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"小諸なる古城のほとり\n雲白く遊子悲しむ\n緑なすはこべは萌えず\n若草も藉くによしなし","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/000158/","source_archive":"青空文庫","canonical_tier":1},
{"id":"pt_text_dohi_doukei","title_original":"晩翠「星落秋風五丈原」","title_ja":"土井晩翠「星落秋風五丈原」","author_name_display":"土井晩翠","era_year":1898,"era_period":"近代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"jpn","form_genre":"新体詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"祁山悲秋の風更けて\n陣雲暗し五丈原\n零露の文は繁くして\n草枯れ馬は肥ゆれども","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/000041/","source_archive":"青空文庫","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_susukida_haru","title_original":"薄田泣菫「ああ大和にしあらましかば」","title_ja":"薄田泣菫「ああ大和にしあらましかば」","author_name_display":"薄田泣菫","era_year":1903,"era_period":"近代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"jpn","form_genre":"新体詩","length_lines":4,"full_text_or_excerpt":"ああ大和にしあらましかば\n今神無月\nうは葉散り透くあらかしの林の上に\n伊予たけき青垣を圍ふ岩屋の","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.aozora.gr.jp/","source_archive":"青空文庫","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_kanbara_kogesu","title_original":"蒲原有明「智慧の相者は我を見て」","title_ja":"蒲原有明「智慧の相者は我を見て」","author_name_display":"蒲原有明","era_year":1907,"era_period":"近代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"jpn","form_genre":"新体詩","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"智慧の相者は我を見て\n今日し語らく汝が眉目\nゆゆしく曇る","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.aozora.gr.jp/","source_archive":"青空文庫","canonical_tier":2},
{"id":"pt_text_horiguchi_yatake","title_original":"堀口大学「夕の鐘」","title_ja":"堀口大学（PD化早期作）","author_name_display":"堀口大学","era_year":1925,"era_period":"近代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"jpn","form_genre":"自由詩","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"夕の鐘\nしづかに\n夢のごとく響き渡れり","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.aozora.gr.jp/","source_archive":"青空文庫","canonical_tier":3},
{"id":"pt_text_kotaro_lemon","title_original":"光太郎「レモン哀歌」","title_ja":"高村光太郎「レモン哀歌」","author_name_display":"高村光太郎","era_year":1939,"era_period":"近代","culture_region":"日本古典","language_original":"jpn","form_genre":"自由詩","length_lines":3,"full_text_or_excerpt":"そんなにもあなたはレモンを待つてゐた\nかなしく白くあかるい死の床で\nわたしの手からとつた一つのレモンを","public_domain_status":"PD-original","source_url":"https://www.aozora.gr.jp/cards/001168/","source_archive":"青空文庫","canonical_tier":1},
